WEBVTT

00:01.427 --> 00:03.637
<b>[ominous music]</b>

00:03.677 --> 00:08.347
<b>Now come clean and admit
your crime, you failure.</b>

00:08.387 --> 00:10.557
<b>What a barbaric,
boring conclusion.</b>

00:10.597 --> 00:13.017
<b>[yelling]</b>

00:13.057 --> 00:15.527
<b>Did you think
a delicate girl like me</b>

00:15.567 --> 00:18.697
<b>would face a barbaric man
like you alone?</b>

00:18.737 --> 00:22.277
<b>[EMILIA] I was hoping Ram was
mistaken about all of this.</b>

00:24.487 --> 00:25.947
<b>[gasps]</b>

00:25.987 --> 00:29.457
<b>Please, tell me
what happened, Subaru.</b>

00:29.497 --> 00:31.207
<b>Why would you do this?</b>

00:31.247 --> 00:32.917
<b>Well-- well, it was--</b>

00:32.957 --> 00:34.837
<b>Maybe he'll feel up
to talking if we introduce</b>

00:34.877 --> 00:36.087
<b>him to my little friend pain.</b>

00:36.127 --> 00:37.457
<b>Wait!</b>

00:37.507 --> 00:39.337
<b>We came to talk to Subaru
since he seemed off!</b>

00:39.377 --> 00:40.507
<b>That's all!</b>

00:40.547 --> 00:42.757
<b>[RAM]
Ms. Emilia, you're too soft.</b>

00:42.797 --> 00:44.347
<b>Don't you remember?</b>

00:44.387 --> 00:46.967
<b>There was a Sin Archbishop
who could take others' forms.</b>

00:47.017 --> 00:48.677
<b>Then couldn't
that Sin Archbishop</b>

00:48.727 --> 00:51.347
<b>taking Barusu's form
be a possibility?</b>

00:51.387 --> 00:52.517
<b>Maybe, but--</b>

00:52.557 --> 00:54.557
<b>I'll make him
tell us everything,</b>

00:54.607 --> 00:56.977
<b>starting with where the
actual Barusu and Meili are.</b>

00:57.027 --> 00:58.687
<b>[gasps] Does that mean
they weren't the ones--</b>

00:58.737 --> 01:00.527
<b>[EMILIA] We can't do this!
- --who moved Meili's body?</b>

01:00.567 --> 01:01.947
<b>How do we decide
whether he's real or not?</b>

01:01.987 --> 01:03.067
<b>[SUBARU]
I lost my memories!</b>

01:03.107 --> 01:04.317
<b>[gasps]</b>

01:07.407 --> 01:08.617
<b>♪ ♪</b>

01:08.657 --> 01:09.657
<b>Now?</b>

01:09.697 --> 01:10.827
<b>After all this?</b>

01:10.867 --> 01:11.997
<b>What kind of game
are you playing?</b>

01:12.037 --> 01:13.077
<b>Ram!</b>

01:13.117 --> 01:14.707
<b>You heard what Subaru said!</b>

01:14.747 --> 01:16.707
<b>There must be
a reason for this!</b>

01:20.047 --> 01:21.587
<b>And Rem?</b>

01:21.627 --> 01:23.337
<b>What happens to Rem?</b>

01:23.387 --> 01:24.297
<b>[gasps]</b>

01:24.337 --> 01:25.967
<b>Stay out of my way!</b>

01:29.847 --> 01:32.137
<b>Tell me again to my face
that you forgot!</b>

01:32.177 --> 01:34.347
<b>No, I-- that's not it.</b>

01:34.397 --> 01:37.437
<b>Tell me with that face
and voice that you forgot Rem.</b>

01:37.477 --> 01:38.777
<b>Say it one more time.</b>

01:38.817 --> 01:39.937
<b>No, don't do it, Ram!</b>

01:39.977 --> 01:41.277
<b>[magic burst]</b>

01:41.317 --> 01:42.567
<b>[grunts]</b>

01:47.617 --> 01:48.577
<b>Damn it!</b>

01:48.617 --> 01:50.367
<b>Ow!</b>

01:52.707 --> 01:54.457
<b>The cage is--</b>

01:56.247 --> 01:58.247
<b>where are Emilia and Ram?</b>

01:58.287 --> 01:59.667
<b>[gasps]</b>

01:59.707 --> 02:03.007
<b>[unsettling music]</b>

02:03.047 --> 02:10.347
<b>♪ ♪</b>

02:11.637 --> 02:12.937
<b>[REID]
Huh?</b>

02:12.977 --> 02:16.137
<b>The hell's up with
this creepy-ass room?</b>

02:16.187 --> 02:17.937
<b>What would make
someone cover a room</b>

02:17.977 --> 02:20.317
<b>with nasty shit
like this anyway?</b>

02:21.567 --> 02:22.947
<b>You freak.</b>

02:29.277 --> 02:31.617
<b>[ominous music]</b>

02:31.657 --> 02:34.077
<b>You're gonna catch flies
if you keep staring like that.</b>

02:34.117 --> 02:35.117
<b>Come on, what's the matter?</b>

02:35.157 --> 02:36.367
<b>You chicken?</b>

02:36.417 --> 02:38.627
<b>You look like you're
gonna start crying.</b>

02:38.667 --> 02:39.917
<b>Hm?</b>

02:41.457 --> 02:43.757
<b>Oh, you get into a fight
with your buddies?</b>

02:43.797 --> 02:44.797
<b>Funny.</b>

02:44.837 --> 02:46.257
<b>Hold on!</b>

02:46.297 --> 02:48.427
<b>You-- you said you were
stuck on the floor above</b>

02:48.467 --> 02:50.547
<b>and couldn't come down
even if you wanted to!</b>

02:50.597 --> 02:51.927
<b>Circumstances change.</b>

02:51.967 --> 02:53.427
<b>Careful what you assume.</b>

02:53.477 --> 02:55.137
<b>But that's just
what you told me.</b>

02:55.177 --> 02:56.187
<b>So how could--</b>

02:56.227 --> 02:57.387
<b>[yelps]</b>

02:57.437 --> 02:58.597
<b>Dumbass.</b>

02:58.647 --> 03:00.317
<b>Don't go thinking
you'll get spoonfed</b>

03:00.357 --> 03:01.977
<b>the answers to everything.</b>

03:02.027 --> 03:05.447
<b>I can leave, so, yeah,
I'm gonna go outside.</b>

03:05.487 --> 03:06.907
<b>Outside of here?</b>

03:06.947 --> 03:08.527
<b>Outside the tower?</b>

03:08.567 --> 03:12.537
<b>But first I gotta clean
up one little regret.</b>

03:12.577 --> 03:14.287
<b>What the hell's
that supposed to mean?</b>

03:14.327 --> 03:15.537
<b>Hey, hold on!</b>

03:15.577 --> 03:17.457
<b>What'll happen with
the exam, then?</b>

03:17.497 --> 03:21.127
<b>[rumbling]</b>

03:22.337 --> 03:24.257
<b>Damn, speak of the devil.</b>

03:24.297 --> 03:25.547
<b>Huh?</b>

03:28.177 --> 03:30.347
<b>[explosion]</b>

03:31.467 --> 03:32.967
<b>[clang]</b>

03:41.267 --> 03:42.517
<b>[roars]</b>

03:42.567 --> 03:45.107
<b>I don't see any
of your other buddies.</b>

03:45.147 --> 03:48.407
<b>Well, guess that makes what
I'm about to do easier.</b>

03:52.487 --> 03:54.157
<b>[clang]</b>

03:56.747 --> 03:58.747
<b>[MEILI] Looks like you've
been handed the perfect chance</b>

03:58.787 --> 04:00.707
<b>to get that guy killed, huh?</b>

04:00.747 --> 04:04.417
<b>And then you'll have another
Book of the Dead to peruse.</b>

04:04.457 --> 04:06.047
<b>[clang]</b>

04:06.797 --> 04:08.047
<b>[gasps]</b>

04:08.797 --> 04:11.337
<b>[beam charging]</b>

04:11.387 --> 04:13.467
<b>[chuckles]</b>

04:13.507 --> 04:14.967
<b>Right behind you!</b>

04:15.007 --> 04:16.637
<b>Julius!</b>

04:16.927 --> 04:19.057
<b>[blast]</b>

04:20.727 --> 04:21.687
<b>[grunts]</b>

04:23.107 --> 04:26.817
<b>Huh. It's a fact that weaklings
don't have a lot of options.</b>

04:26.857 --> 04:30.027
<b>All they can get good
at is making excuses.</b>

04:30.067 --> 04:31.277
<b>[gasps]</b>

04:32.817 --> 04:33.867
<b>Huh?</b>

04:33.907 --> 04:35.197
<b>[thud, splat]</b>

04:38.827 --> 04:39.957
<b>Why are you--</b>

04:39.997 --> 04:41.367
<b>how are you here?</b>

04:41.417 --> 04:43.827
<b>Why are you,
what are you, how are you--</b>

04:43.877 --> 04:47.007
<b>you sound as stupid as your
buddy up there, you know that?</b>

04:47.047 --> 04:48.917
<b>[roars]</b>

04:50.047 --> 04:53.887
<b>Come on, come on,
come on, come on, come on!</b>

04:53.927 --> 04:55.557
<b>[flesh tearing]</b>

04:59.057 --> 05:02.057
<b>Right then,
let's get back to the exam.</b>

05:02.097 --> 05:06.107
<b>Now try to rip this out of my
hands before I get bored, kid.</b>

05:06.147 --> 05:07.397
<b>[exhales]</b>

05:08.067 --> 05:09.397
<b>Huh?</b>

05:09.437 --> 05:12.857
<b>Echidna and Ms. Anastasia
are in your hands!</b>

05:12.907 --> 05:14.117
<b>[gasps]</b>

05:17.527 --> 05:18.827
<b>[REID]
Huh.</b>

05:19.697 --> 05:20.907
<b>Look at that.</b>

05:20.957 --> 05:23.707
<b>Chivalry's not dead
after all, huh?</b>

05:23.747 --> 05:24.957
<b>[clang]</b>

05:28.587 --> 05:32.967
<b>[heavy breathing]</b>

05:33.007 --> 05:35.387
<b>And where do you
think you're going?</b>

05:38.677 --> 05:41.687
<b>Why would you go out of your
way to help that guy anyway?</b>

05:43.187 --> 05:46.057
<b>You rubbed my neck, so what's
with the special treatment?</b>

05:47.017 --> 05:47.977
<b>Subaru!</b>

05:48.017 --> 05:49.277
<b>I was looking for you!</b>

05:49.317 --> 05:51.237
<b>Going that way is
dangerous, I suppose!</b>

05:51.277 --> 05:52.737
<b>[ECHIDNA]
Why are you outside the cage?</b>

05:52.777 --> 05:54.607
<b>Beatrice, get away
from him at once!</b>

05:54.657 --> 05:56.157
<b>It's just as Ram told me.</b>

05:56.197 --> 05:57.697
<b>He isn't the Natsuki
you all know.</b>

05:57.737 --> 05:59.487
<b>[SUBARU]
Ram?</b>

05:59.537 --> 06:02.577
<b>That means I must not have
killed Emilia and Ram, then.</b>

06:02.617 --> 06:04.167
<b>That's not true
in the slightest!</b>

06:04.207 --> 06:06.667
<b>Once I hold his hand,
I'll know for sure, I suppose!</b>

06:06.707 --> 06:09.377
<b>Even if it's not,
he can't be trusted.</b>

06:09.417 --> 06:12.667
<b>I should have obeyed Ana's gut
instinct from the beginning.</b>

06:12.717 --> 06:14.297
<b>I should have come alone.</b>

06:14.337 --> 06:17.587
<b>None of this would have
happened if I'd just listened.</b>

06:17.637 --> 06:19.757
<b>This is my failure.</b>

06:19.807 --> 06:21.057
<b>[SUBARU]
So what if it is?</b>

06:21.097 --> 06:22.177
<b>It doesn't matter!</b>

06:22.227 --> 06:23.137
<b>[gasps]</b>

06:23.187 --> 06:24.557
<b>This tower's done for.</b>

06:24.597 --> 06:26.227
<b>What's gotten
into you, Subaru?</b>

06:26.267 --> 06:28.817
<b>It's not like you
to accept defeat, I suppose.</b>

06:28.857 --> 06:30.767
<b>What exactly is
like me anyway?</b>

06:30.817 --> 06:33.527
<b>Where is the me you guys are
expecting when you look at me?</b>

06:33.567 --> 06:35.647
<b>So you still won't
be honest, pathetically</b>

06:35.697 --> 06:38.317
<b>holding on to the lie that
you lost your memories?</b>

06:38.367 --> 06:40.277
<b>Ram's forgotten
her own twin sister,</b>

06:40.327 --> 06:42.747
<b>and Julius has been forgotten
by every other person,</b>

06:42.787 --> 06:44.867
<b>and you still insist
on keeping up this cruel act?</b>

06:44.907 --> 06:45.917
<b>Act?</b>

06:45.957 --> 06:47.627
<b>You think this is an act?</b>

06:47.667 --> 06:49.667
<b>Are you seriously trying
to say that what I'm doing now</b>

06:49.707 --> 06:51.297
<b>is an act?</b>

06:51.337 --> 06:53.337
<b>If I was that good at acting,
don't you think I'd act out</b>

06:53.377 --> 06:54.757
<b>something better than this?</b>

06:54.797 --> 06:56.467
<b>If I had the privilege
of choosing my own role,</b>

06:56.507 --> 06:58.587
<b>why the hell would I want
to be Subaru Natsuki,</b>

06:58.637 --> 07:01.757
<b>a disgusting,
useless creep like this?</b>

07:01.807 --> 07:03.677
<b>None of you know
a single thing about what</b>

07:03.717 --> 07:04.677
<b>I've suffered through!</b>

07:04.727 --> 07:06.137
<b>Who even am I?</b>

07:06.187 --> 07:09.147
<b>I've lost everything,
everything I've ever known!</b>

07:09.187 --> 07:11.567
<b>I was on my way home from
the convenience store!</b>

07:11.607 --> 07:13.187
<b>Aside from the clerk
working there,</b>

07:13.237 --> 07:14.897
<b>I hadn't talked
to anyone all day!</b>

07:14.947 --> 07:17.907
<b>And suddenly, I'm just in
another world, a tower in sand,</b>

07:17.947 --> 07:20.407
<b>corpses, exams, fakes!</b>

07:20.447 --> 07:22.027
<b>Subaru Natsuki!</b>

07:22.077 --> 07:23.697
<b>This is insanity!</b>

07:23.747 --> 07:24.697
<b>Whatever!</b>

07:24.747 --> 07:26.497
<b>Screw all of you!</b>

07:28.787 --> 07:31.297
<b>I bet you're wondering why
I just suddenly lost my shit,</b>

07:31.337 --> 07:32.337
<b>aren't you?</b>

07:32.377 --> 07:33.707
<b>Well, I reached my limit.</b>

07:33.757 --> 07:35.627
<b>I was pushed too far,
and something in me</b>

07:35.667 --> 07:37.337
<b>eventually snapped!</b>

07:37.377 --> 07:40.927
<b>I can't do anything useful
here, even if I give it my all!</b>

07:40.967 --> 07:42.347
<b>I tried!</b>

07:43.887 --> 07:47.097
<b>So please,
forgive me for failing.</b>

07:48.437 --> 07:50.517
<b>I'm begging you.</b>

07:50.557 --> 07:54.017
<b>Please just let me
go back home already.</b>

07:54.067 --> 07:57.107
<b>If this is God's way of trying
to punish me for something,</b>

07:57.147 --> 08:00.067
<b>then I understand.</b>

08:00.117 --> 08:03.577
<b>I take responsibility
for my actions!</b>

08:04.867 --> 08:05.947
<b>Subaru.</b>

08:07.197 --> 08:09.917
<b>Beatrice, you should go
with him for the time being.</b>

08:09.957 --> 08:11.917
<b>I'll search for Julius myself.</b>

08:11.957 --> 08:12.957
<b>Understood.</b>

08:12.997 --> 08:13.917
<b>Come on.</b>

08:13.957 --> 08:15.497
<b>Subaru, for now just--</b>

08:16.917 --> 08:18.217
<b>[ECHIDNA]
What's the meaning of this?</b>

08:18.257 --> 08:19.377
<b>Explain.</b>

08:19.427 --> 08:21.297
<b>I considered that a compromise.</b>

08:21.337 --> 08:23.547
<b>Why are you
stopping me right now?</b>

08:25.507 --> 08:27.637
<b>Because Julius asked me to.</b>

08:27.677 --> 08:28.977
<b>Stop lying.</b>

08:31.647 --> 08:35.067
<b>[roars]</b>

08:35.107 --> 08:36.487
<b>[gasps]</b>

08:36.517 --> 08:39.237
<b>Incomplete EMT, I suppose!</b>

08:39.277 --> 08:40.697
<b>[magic barrage]</b>

08:40.737 --> 08:44.117
<b>[explosions]</b>

08:44.157 --> 08:45.157
<b>[shrieks]</b>

08:45.197 --> 08:46.407
<b>[gasps]</b>

08:49.367 --> 08:52.957
<b>Natsuki, please don't do
such unpredictable things.</b>

08:52.997 --> 08:54.037
<b>It's confusing.</b>

08:54.087 --> 08:55.787
<b>Like I had enough
time to think.</b>

08:55.837 --> 08:57.297
<b>And my body just moved!</b>

08:57.337 --> 08:58.297
<b>[gasps]</b>

08:58.337 --> 08:59.967
<b>[roars]</b>

09:00.007 --> 09:01.217
<b>El Jiwald!</b>

09:01.257 --> 09:03.177
<b>[blast]</b>

09:03.217 --> 09:05.927
<b>[explosion]</b>

09:07.717 --> 09:10.927
<b>[roars]</b>

09:15.647 --> 09:16.857
<b>[ECHIDNA]
I don't get it.</b>

09:16.897 --> 09:18.817
<b>Just what are you?</b>

09:18.857 --> 09:20.607
<b>What do you hope to accomplish?</b>

09:20.647 --> 09:22.277
<b>Whose side are you on?</b>

09:22.317 --> 09:24.367
<b>I don't have
an answer either.</b>

09:26.117 --> 09:27.777
<b>I really did.</b>

09:27.827 --> 09:29.577
<b>You lost your memories?</b>

09:30.707 --> 09:32.617
<b>You don't even remember
when you took Betty</b>

09:32.657 --> 09:34.787
<b>out of the mansion, I suppose?</b>

09:34.827 --> 09:36.957
<b>I don't.</b>

09:36.997 --> 09:38.457
<b>Sorry.</b>

09:38.507 --> 09:40.257
<b>[BEATRICE] It's fine.
- [gasps]</b>

09:40.297 --> 09:41.797
<b>[BEATRICE]
Even if you've forgotten it,</b>

09:41.837 --> 09:44.427
<b>Subaru, Betty never will.</b>

09:44.467 --> 09:46.137
<b>Not ever.</b>

09:48.307 --> 09:49.347
<b>Let's get moving.</b>

09:49.387 --> 09:51.387
<b>We can't stay here any longer.</b>

09:51.427 --> 09:53.137
<b>Echidna, are you sure?</b>

09:53.187 --> 09:55.517
<b>I still have
my misgivings about you,</b>

09:55.557 --> 09:58.227
<b>but right now I have
to choose my priorities,</b>

09:58.267 --> 10:00.737
<b>a necessary mindset
for a merchant.</b>

10:00.777 --> 10:03.817
<b>By now, I've had plenty
of time to see that myself.</b>

10:03.857 --> 10:05.277
<b>All right, then.</b>

10:05.317 --> 10:08.527
<b>[footsteps]</b>

10:11.747 --> 10:13.957
<b>[roars]</b>

10:19.627 --> 10:23.007
<b>[melancholy music, groaning]</b>

10:23.047 --> 10:28.387
<b>♪ ♪</b>

10:28.427 --> 10:29.467
<b>Enough.</b>

10:29.507 --> 10:30.887
<b>Just--</b>

10:31.477 --> 10:33.427
<b>just leave me here.</b>

10:34.637 --> 10:37.897
<b>Damn it,
damn it, damn it all!</b>

10:37.937 --> 10:42.607
<b>Natsuki, you've done enough.</b>

10:42.647 --> 10:44.147
<b>[SUBARU]
Like hell I have.</b>

10:44.187 --> 10:48.737
<b>Nothing I've done has ever,
ever been enough at all.</b>

10:48.777 --> 10:51.577
<b>I'm not the one you
should worry about.</b>

10:51.617 --> 10:53.697
<b>Shouldn't you help
Beatrice first?</b>

10:53.747 --> 10:54.707
<b>[gasps]</b>

10:54.747 --> 10:57.127
<b>[roar, explosion, shriek]</b>

10:57.167 --> 10:59.377
<b>[grunts]</b>

11:00.457 --> 11:03.417
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

11:03.467 --> 11:06.967
<b>That poor girl was
truly unfortunate.</b>

11:09.427 --> 11:11.347
<b>It hurts.</b>

11:11.387 --> 11:12.637
<b>How it hurts.</b>

11:13.977 --> 11:17.767
<b>Human bodies sure
feel a lot of pain.</b>

11:17.807 --> 11:18.977
<b>Sorry.</b>

11:19.017 --> 11:20.147
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

11:20.187 --> 11:22.107
<b>It's not-- I didn't mean to--</b>

11:22.147 --> 11:23.397
<b>I--</b>

11:23.437 --> 11:26.357
<b>[ECHIDNA] This pain
I feel is the only way</b>

11:26.397 --> 11:28.907
<b>I can ever repay Ana.</b>

11:28.947 --> 11:31.367
<b>It's true, right?</b>

11:31.407 --> 11:33.907
<b>If I returned her
body to her now,</b>

11:33.947 --> 11:36.577
<b>she'd have to feel this pain</b>

11:36.617 --> 11:40.587
<b>and the fear of death
closing in on her.</b>

11:40.627 --> 11:41.997
<b>It's OK.</b>

11:42.037 --> 11:45.627
<b>Don't try to stop it.</b>

11:47.047 --> 11:49.887
<b>I'm ready to fall to hell.</b>

11:49.927 --> 11:50.967
<b>Oh, wow.</b>

11:51.007 --> 11:52.797
<b>Do you hear what she's saying?</b>

11:52.847 --> 11:56.177
<b>I believe this situation is
what they call a windfall.</b>

12:01.687 --> 12:04.437
<b>You're doing
the right thing, Subaru,</b>

12:04.477 --> 12:07.237
<b>putting the poor thing
out of her misery.</b>

12:21.917 --> 12:23.287
<b>Hm?</b>

12:23.337 --> 12:27.047
<b>[heavy breathing]</b>

12:28.257 --> 12:29.257
<b>[groans]</b>

12:29.297 --> 12:30.507
<b>[gasps]</b>

12:36.177 --> 12:37.677
<b>[SUBARU]
You can't--</b>

12:37.727 --> 12:40.977
<b>you can't even do
something that simple,</b>

12:41.017 --> 12:43.057
<b>Subaru Natsuki.</b>

12:44.857 --> 12:47.687
<b>Natsuki,</b>

12:47.737 --> 12:50.237
<b>you can't even lift a rock</b>

12:50.277 --> 12:53.277
<b>to put me out of my misery?</b>

12:55.077 --> 12:58.287
<b>I'm sorry for doubting you.</b>

13:05.377 --> 13:07.337
<b>Why don't you just die?</b>

13:11.217 --> 13:12.217
<b>Yeah, sure.</b>

13:12.257 --> 13:13.387
<b>Why not?</b>

13:13.427 --> 13:17.637
<b>[growling]</b>

13:20.767 --> 13:22.097
<b>[SATELLA]
I love you.</b>

13:26.977 --> 13:28.277
<b>I love you.</b>

13:28.317 --> 13:29.737
