13:36.527 --> 13:39.287
<b>Stop it!
I've had enough of this,</b>

13:39.327 --> 13:41.037
<b>when I don't feel that way!</b>

13:41.077 --> 13:42.827
<b>I've never--</b>

13:42.867 --> 13:46.087
<b>I've never,
ever loved myself.</b>

13:46.127 --> 13:49.337
<b>I already knew
that I was loved.</b>

13:49.377 --> 13:51.797
<b>I knew it!</b>

13:51.837 --> 13:55.177
<b>My mom and dad, both
of them loved me so much</b>

13:55.217 --> 13:56.887
<b>from the bottom
of their hearts.</b>

13:56.927 --> 13:58.047
<b>I knew it.</b>

13:58.097 --> 14:00.097
<b>How the hell could I not?</b>

14:01.927 --> 14:05.937
<b>That's why I wished
I could just disappear.</b>

14:05.977 --> 14:07.897
<b>My parents loved
me so much,</b>

14:07.937 --> 14:10.107
<b>but I could never love
someone as pathetic as me,</b>

14:10.147 --> 14:12.357
<b>someone who
wasn't worth loving!</b>

14:12.397 --> 14:13.897
<b>I love you.</b>

14:13.947 --> 14:15.157
<b>Stop saying that!</b>

14:15.197 --> 14:16.157
<b>Give me a break!</b>

14:16.197 --> 14:17.157
<b>Isn't this enough already?</b>

14:17.197 --> 14:18.197
<b>I love you.</b>

14:18.237 --> 14:19.787
<b>I pretended
I couldn't see it,</b>

14:19.827 --> 14:22.907
<b>but deep down, I already
knew the answer ages ago!</b>

14:22.957 --> 14:25.327
<b>The people who tried so
desperately with all they had,</b>

14:25.377 --> 14:27.337
<b>went out of their way
to show me such kindness!</b>

14:27.377 --> 14:29.957
<b>There's no way they
could be bad people!</b>

14:29.997 --> 14:31.717
<b>And I knew that!</b>

14:33.507 --> 14:35.797
<b>That's why it would
have been better</b>

14:35.837 --> 14:38.387
<b>for everyone if I just died.</b>

14:38.427 --> 14:40.967
<b>If this is the last thing
I can do,</b>

14:41.007 --> 14:42.807
<b>if this can be the end</b>

14:42.847 --> 14:45.977
<b>and Subaru Natsuki
can just disappear--</b>

14:47.557 --> 14:48.807
<b>I love you.</b>

14:48.857 --> 14:50.267
<b>I love you.</b>

14:50.317 --> 14:51.647
<b>I love you.</b>

14:51.687 --> 14:53.027
<b>I love you.</b>

14:53.067 --> 14:54.397
<b>I love you.</b>

14:54.437 --> 14:55.737
<b>I love you.</b>

14:55.777 --> 14:57.067
<b>I love you.</b>

14:57.107 --> 14:58.487
<b>I love you.</b>

14:58.527 --> 14:59.907
<b>I love you.</b>

14:59.947 --> 15:01.367
<b>I love you.</b>

15:01.407 --> 15:02.827
<b>I love you.</b>

15:02.867 --> 15:04.287
<b>I love you.</b>

15:04.327 --> 15:05.707
<b>I love you.</b>

15:05.747 --> 15:06.997
<b>I love you.</b>

15:07.037 --> 15:08.377
<b>I love you.</b>

15:08.417 --> 15:09.877
<b>I love you.</b>

15:09.917 --> 15:11.417
<b>I love you.</b>

15:11.457 --> 15:12.797
<b>I love you.</b>

15:12.837 --> 15:14.337
<b>I love you.</b>

15:14.377 --> 15:15.757
<b>I love you.</b>

15:15.797 --> 15:16.967
<b>I love you.</b>

15:17.007 --> 15:17.967
<b>I love you.</b>

15:18.007 --> 15:19.097
<b>[EMILIA]
That's enough!</b>

15:19.137 --> 15:20.387
<b>[sword slash]</b>

15:21.807 --> 15:23.057
<b>Subaru!</b>

15:25.767 --> 15:29.397
<b>[panting]</b>

15:37.147 --> 15:38.147
<b>[SUBARU]
I'm done.</b>

15:38.197 --> 15:39.157
<b>Huh?</b>

15:39.197 --> 15:40.487
<b>I'm done with this!</b>

15:43.117 --> 15:44.827
<b>Why are you trying
so hard to help me?</b>

15:44.867 --> 15:46.037
<b>Subaru.</b>

15:46.077 --> 15:47.287
<b>[SUBARU]
Something's wrong with you,</b>

15:47.327 --> 15:50.917
<b>you and Julius
and Beatrice, too!</b>

15:50.957 --> 15:52.587
<b>For some reason,
even Echidna was</b>

15:52.627 --> 15:54.797
<b>apologizing to me in the end!</b>

15:54.837 --> 15:56.587
<b>It doesn't make any sense!</b>

15:56.627 --> 15:57.587
<b>Wait, hold on.</b>

15:57.627 --> 15:59.177
<b>In the end?</b>

15:59.217 --> 16:01.097
<b>Subaru, what happened?</b>

16:01.137 --> 16:02.217
<b>Where are Echidna and--</b>

16:02.257 --> 16:03.347
<b>She's dead!</b>

16:03.387 --> 16:04.427
<b>Her legs were blown off.</b>

16:04.467 --> 16:05.477
<b>It was bad.</b>

16:05.517 --> 16:06.847
<b>She lost so much blood!</b>

16:06.887 --> 16:08.727
<b>Beatrice got blown away, too!</b>

16:08.767 --> 16:09.977
<b>[gasps]</b>

16:13.357 --> 16:16.987
<b>And Julius, he told me
to go to take care of them.</b>

16:17.027 --> 16:18.277
<b>Idiot.</b>

16:19.107 --> 16:20.617
<b>They're all idiots.</b>

16:22.907 --> 16:25.987
<b>What exactly are they
expecting me to do?</b>

16:26.037 --> 16:28.867
<b>Take care of them
and get her back?</b>

16:28.907 --> 16:31.167
<b>You're sorry that
you've doubted me?</b>

16:32.247 --> 16:33.877
<b>What are you saying?</b>

16:39.337 --> 16:43.097
<b>The very first time that you
and I met was in the capital</b>

16:43.137 --> 16:44.847
<b>at a place called
the Loot House.</b>

16:44.887 --> 16:45.847
<b>Huh?</b>

16:45.887 --> 16:46.887
<b>[sentimental music]</b>

16:46.927 --> 16:49.227
<b>At the time, my insignia,</b>

16:49.267 --> 16:50.977
<b>which is something
really important to me,</b>

16:51.017 --> 16:52.357
<b>was stolen by Felt.</b>

16:52.397 --> 16:54.767
<b>We knew we had
to find a way to get it back,</b>

16:54.817 --> 16:57.227
<b>and Puck and I were panicking.</b>

16:57.277 --> 16:59.897
<b>Then, once we chased Felt down,</b>

16:59.947 --> 17:02.947
<b>Meili's older sister
came after me.</b>

17:02.987 --> 17:06.447
<b>But you saved my life
as a stranger.</b>

17:06.487 --> 17:07.827
<b>Huh?</b>

17:07.867 --> 17:09.157
<b>That's it.</b>

17:09.197 --> 17:11.787
<b>That's how you and I
first met each other.</b>

17:13.837 --> 17:15.207
<b>Remember?</b>

17:17.457 --> 17:20.587
<b>Also, you were badly
injured while protecting me.</b>

17:20.627 --> 17:22.387
<b>It was rough.</b>

17:22.427 --> 17:24.927
<b>I couldn't leave you, so I took
you back to Roswaal's mansion</b>

17:24.967 --> 17:25.927
<b>with me.</b>

17:25.967 --> 17:27.517
<b>Beatrice healed you there,</b>

17:27.557 --> 17:31.097
<b>although she did complain
about it the entire time.</b>

17:31.137 --> 17:36.767
<b>Then Ram and Rem surely became
good friends with you as well.</b>

17:38.567 --> 17:40.487
<b>And a bit later on,
Meili showed up</b>

17:40.527 --> 17:42.907
<b>without her big sister
and sent mabeasts to do</b>

17:42.947 --> 17:44.447
<b>evil things to us.</b>

17:44.487 --> 17:46.657
<b>It's OK because you
and Ram stopped her.</b>

17:46.697 --> 17:49.287
<b>Roswaal jumped in to take
care of the mabeasts,</b>

17:49.327 --> 17:51.577
<b>and I just stayed home.</b>

17:51.617 --> 17:54.247
<b>That's when we promised
to go on a date together.</b>

17:55.327 --> 17:56.707
<b>Remember that?</b>

17:59.247 --> 18:03.087
<b>♪ ♪</b>

18:03.127 --> 18:05.337
<b>Soon after,
I was called to the capital</b>

18:05.387 --> 18:07.637
<b>for the royal selection,</b>

18:07.677 --> 18:12.887
<b>and you and I got into a
seriously big fight back then.</b>

18:12.937 --> 18:15.857
<b>It was because I didn't
want you to be reckless.</b>

18:15.897 --> 18:17.977
<b>It was hard watching
you get hurt.</b>

18:18.017 --> 18:20.437
<b>And I didn't understand
why you were being so kind</b>

18:20.477 --> 18:21.987
<b>to me either.</b>

18:22.027 --> 18:23.737
<b>I was scared.</b>

18:23.777 --> 18:28.237
<b>So when we fought,
I was sure it was all over.</b>

18:28.277 --> 18:33.367
<b>But when I didn't understand
what was happening</b>

18:33.407 --> 18:37.287
<b>and I found myself trapped
in a precarious situation,</b>

18:37.327 --> 18:38.837
<b>Subaru, you--</b>

18:38.877 --> 18:40.337
<b>you came for me.</b>

18:40.377 --> 18:41.297
<b>And--</b>

18:41.337 --> 18:46.257
<b>♪ ♪</b>

18:46.297 --> 18:47.717
<b>And then you--</b>

18:47.757 --> 18:50.057
<b>you told me something.</b>

18:50.097 --> 18:51.057
<b>You remember?</b>

18:51.097 --> 18:57.977
<b>♪ ♪</b>

18:59.357 --> 19:04.237
<b>Well, I remember all of it,
everything you said for me,</b>

19:04.277 --> 19:06.027
<b>everything you did for me,</b>

19:06.067 --> 19:08.827
<b>and all the promises
for the future.</b>

19:08.867 --> 19:10.987
<b>It's all right here.</b>

19:12.237 --> 19:14.157
<b>I don't remember.</b>

19:14.197 --> 19:16.457
<b>I can't remember any of it.</b>

19:16.497 --> 19:19.877
<b>You-- what's with you,
with all of you?</b>

19:19.917 --> 19:22.047
<b>Who the hell are you
talking about, huh?</b>

19:22.087 --> 19:24.377
<b>Someone capable
of risking his life for others,</b>

19:24.417 --> 19:26.217
<b>someone not
afraid to take action,</b>

19:26.257 --> 19:29.137
<b>someone who won't hesitate
to help those he cares about,</b>

19:29.177 --> 19:31.307
<b>someone who could put his own
life on the line to accomplish</b>

19:31.347 --> 19:32.677
<b>what he puts his mind to?</b>

19:32.717 --> 19:34.307
<b>Don't lie to me!</b>

19:34.347 --> 19:36.847
<b>Someone like that can't
be Subaru Natsuki!</b>

19:36.887 --> 19:38.857
<b>I know better than
anyone just how</b>

19:38.897 --> 19:41.397
<b>pathetic and useless a
human being Subaru Natsuki is,</b>

19:41.437 --> 19:44.647
<b>a good-for-nothing scumbag,
rotten to the core.</b>

19:44.687 --> 19:46.857
<b>Subaru Natsuki is
a good-for-nothing scumbag,</b>

19:46.897 --> 19:47.897
<b>rotten to the core!</b>

19:47.947 --> 19:49.117
<b>I know it!</b>

19:49.157 --> 19:51.407
<b>I know that better
than anyone else!</b>

19:53.407 --> 19:55.287
<b>♪ ♪</b>

19:55.327 --> 19:58.537
<b>Wouldn't it be better
if it wasn't me?</b>

20:00.167 --> 20:03.457
<b>There are plenty of people much
stronger and much smarter, too,</b>

20:03.497 --> 20:05.297
<b>so they should do it instead.</b>

20:05.337 --> 20:07.627
<b>But I can never
be that someone.</b>

20:07.667 --> 20:08.627
<b>I can't.</b>

20:08.677 --> 20:10.087
<b>It's too much.</b>

20:15.307 --> 20:17.177
<b>My name is Emilia,</b>

20:17.217 --> 20:18.887
<b>only Emilia.</b>

20:23.227 --> 20:25.647
<b>There's so much
I need to tell you,</b>

20:25.687 --> 20:27.487
<b>that I need to ask you,</b>

20:27.527 --> 20:29.907
<b>more than you can imagine.</b>

20:29.947 --> 20:32.907
<b>But right now,
tell me one thing.</b>

20:34.407 --> 20:37.787
<b>All I ask is that you
please tell me your name.</b>

20:39.827 --> 20:42.327
<b>Why is it me?</b>

20:42.377 --> 20:44.917
<b>Why does it still have
to be Subaru Natsuki now?</b>

20:44.957 --> 20:46.337
<b>What the hell could he even do?</b>

20:46.377 --> 20:49.757
<b>What are you expecting
from him this time?</b>

20:49.797 --> 20:52.427
<b>What you were saying
before might be right.</b>

20:52.467 --> 20:54.927
<b>There are people who are
much stronger than you.</b>

20:54.967 --> 20:58.177
<b>And I'm sure there are plenty
who are smarter as well.</b>

20:58.227 --> 21:01.477
<b>But no matter what's
happening in my world,</b>

21:01.517 --> 21:03.647
<b>you're the only one
I want to be with.</b>

21:03.687 --> 21:05.477
<b>I hope and believe
that you'll always be</b>

21:05.517 --> 21:09.027
<b>there for me, truly, because--</b>

21:10.277 --> 21:12.317
<b>because if I ever need saving,</b>

21:12.357 --> 21:14.197
<b>I don't want it to be
by someone who does it</b>

21:14.237 --> 21:16.657
<b>because they can
or they're there.</b>

21:17.947 --> 21:20.827
<b>You see, I'd be
a million times happier</b>

21:20.867 --> 21:22.877
<b>if it's by someone I love.</b>

21:27.877 --> 21:29.627
<b>So that was it.</b>

21:31.507 --> 21:35.547
<b>Subaru Natsuki, you were
head over heels in love</b>

21:35.597 --> 21:37.887
<b>with a beautiful
girl like this.</b>

21:37.927 --> 21:41.677
<b>And that love became the source
of your strength, huh?</b>

21:43.187 --> 21:44.807
<b>Give me a break.</b>

21:44.857 --> 21:46.817
<b>Could she be any more
out of your league, bro?</b>

21:46.857 --> 21:49.317
<b>Seriously, where do you
get off aiming so high?</b>

21:49.357 --> 21:53.567
<b>How does a loser like you
end up with a beauty like her?</b>

21:53.607 --> 21:55.907
<b>Again,
my name is Emilia,</b>

21:55.947 --> 21:57.407
<b>only Emilia.</b>

22:03.407 --> 22:07.377
<b>Please, I'd love if you'd
tell me your name.</b>

22:08.627 --> 22:12.007
<b>[sentimental music]</b>

22:12.047 --> 22:19.347
<b>♪ ♪</b>

22:24.637 --> 22:25.807
<b>[gasps]</b>

22:27.057 --> 22:30.727
<b>All right, my name
is Subaru Natsuki,</b>

22:30.777 --> 22:33.067
<b>the man Julius trusted,</b>

22:33.107 --> 22:35.357
<b>Beatrice believed in,</b>

22:35.397 --> 22:37.117
<b>Echidna forgave,</b>

22:37.157 --> 22:40.117
<b>and you, Emilia, hoped for.</b>

22:40.157 --> 22:43.577
<b>If the name of that man who's
earned that is Subaru Natsuki,</b>

22:43.617 --> 22:46.457
<b>then I am Subaru Natsuki.</b>

22:46.497 --> 22:48.837
<b>I want to help Emilia
and everyone else.</b>

22:48.877 --> 22:50.997
<b>I want to save them
from this tower.</b>

22:51.047 --> 22:53.377
<b>If that's something
Subaru Natsuki can do,</b>

22:53.417 --> 22:55.467
<b>I'm going to do it.</b>

22:55.507 --> 22:59.677
<b>Thank you, Emilia, for letting
me believe that for myself.</b>

23:01.427 --> 23:03.927
<b>Subaru, I--</b>

23:03.977 --> 23:07.307
<b>[rumbling, gasps]</b>

23:07.357 --> 23:11.067
<b>♪ ♪</b>

23:11.107 --> 23:12.527
<b>Emilia!</b>

23:14.987 --> 23:16.697
<b>Emilia!</b>

23:18.987 --> 23:26.327
<b>♪ ♪</b>

23:29.587 --> 23:31.047
<b>Subaru!</b>

23:31.837 --> 23:33.087
<b>[gasps]</b>

23:36.507 --> 23:40.387
<b>Is this gonna end with us
getting swallowed up by that?</b>

23:40.427 --> 23:43.267
<b>No, this is not the end.</b>

23:43.307 --> 23:48.767
<b>This-- this is going to be
where it finally begins!</b>

23:48.807 --> 23:50.057
<b>I will remember.</b>

23:50.107 --> 23:53.477
<b>I'll remember everything!</b>

23:55.437 --> 23:58.647
<b>Even if you were to forget me,</b>

23:58.697 --> 24:02.197
<b>I'll never forget any of you!</b>

24:05.157 --> 24:06.247
<b>[EMILIA]
Subaru!</b>

24:06.287 --> 24:07.997
<b>Hey, Subaru!</b>

24:08.037 --> 24:09.287
<b>Are you all right?</b>

24:14.547 --> 24:15.877
<b>Oh, what a relief.</b>

24:15.917 --> 24:18.127
<b>I was really worried about you.</b>

24:18.167 --> 24:19.757
<b>[BEATRICE] Emilia,
you need to be firmer with him,</b>

24:19.797 --> 24:22.097
<b>or he won't feel bad
about what he's done.</b>

24:26.637 --> 24:29.017
<b>This time will be different.</b>
